-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- rules and positions
-- a rule: k metavariable-bound pattern depth, left side, right side, and its justification: the
-- theorem of the store it was read from (its global g, the number n of its Π-bound variables, and
-- whether it is read right to left), or none for a hand-written rule, which navigation may use but
-- the specializer refuses (a rewrite it cannot justify by a path is not a rewrite it makes)
data Just = nojust | thm (g : Word) (n : Word) (rev : Bool)
